     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "[Followup from Sourceforge Tracker]",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "Followup Submitter: cwilper",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "Logged In: YES ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "user_id=189298",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "Originator: NO",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "The folks at Tufts are also seeing the \"Error: Error",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "closing session. Forced close required\" with 3.0b1.  ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "In their case, rebuilding fails after 800 objects.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Excerpt of email from Sho Nakagama:",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "my impression (with no underlying research mind you) is that this is a either a Mulgara bug or the rebuild index script needs to allocate more memory.  Right now I'm assuming the former because the only memory issue would be the object it's dealing with right then, since it writes to disk what it has already processed...",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Also (again without rigorous research) the error I see originates from Mulgara, not the rebuild script.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
