  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Rebuilder throws an exception at the end of running an RI rebuild, resulting in a corrupt/incomplete index when configured to use Mulgara store.  Seems to be >50% failure rate on a repository of about 4000 objects.  This issue does not seem to be present with an MPTStore-backed RI.  ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Originally reported by Rozita Fridman:",
