  "description": "<p>Rebuilder throws an exception at the end of running an RI rebuild, resulting in a corrupt/incomplete index when configured to use Mulgara store.  Seems to be &gt;50% failure rate on a repository of about 4000 objects.  This issue does not seem to be present with an MPTStore-backed RI.  </p>\n\n\n<p>Originally reported by Rozita Fridman:<br/>\n<a href=\"http://sourceforge.net/mailarchive/forum.php?thread_name=561B608813F3E7448D792A51EF2AB03E01C5C5CF%40EXCLUSTER.fiz-karlsruhe.de&amp;forum_name=fedora-commons-developers\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://sourceforge.net/mailarchive/forum.php?thread_name=561B608813F3E7448D792A51EF2AB03E01C5C5CF%40EXCLUSTER.fiz-karlsruhe.de&amp;forum_name=fedora-commons-developers</a></p>",
